  "description": "Snowelle is an elegant handwritten script font featuring graceful flowing strokes, delicate curves, and a refined calligraphy-inspired style. Its romantic and sophisticated letterforms create a natural handwritten appearance, making it perfect for wedding invitations, logos, branding, greeting cards, quotes, stationery, fashion designs, social media graphics, product packaging, mugs, T-shirts, and other creative projects. Snowelle adds a timeless, personal, and stylish touch to both modern and classic designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Snowelle is an elegant handwritten script font featuring graceful flowing strokes, delicate curves, and a refined calligraphy-inspired style. Its romantic and sophisticated letterforms create a natural handwritten appearance, making it perfect for wedding invitations, logos, branding, greeting cards, quotes, stationery, fashion designs, social media graphics, product packaging, mugs, T-shirts, and other creative projects. Snowelle adds a timeless, personal, and stylish touch to both modern and classic designs.</p>",
